  <item>
    <title>E21 消费观大碰撞：我花的省的都不是钱，是我的人生掌控权！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6818709147ebeede7ed43331</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6818709147ebeede7ed43331</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 May 2025 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【导读】</span></p><span></span><p><span>「省钱猪猪女孩」菠菜从小在价格敏感的家庭环境中成长，将「低成本达成目标」刻入消费基因；而「精致都市丽人」吖施则以体验和生活品质为优先，信奉「钱是工具而非主人」。从童年经历、家庭影响、社会规训等维度，剖析消费观的塑造逻辑，揭示消费背后的心理博弈，指向一个共同内核：​​消费无关对错，关键在于你是否成为金钱的掌控者​​。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 消费观的碰撞：省钱与精致消费的对话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> 从小对价格敏感的影响及消费观形成</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="592">09:52</a> 消费观念：体验优先与价格敏感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">14:17</a> 家庭财富观对个人消费行为的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1069">17:49</a> 消费观念：本质需求与品牌价值的考量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a> 从低价优先到体验优先的消费观念转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a> 消费观念的形成与变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a> 金钱观与消费观的反思与成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2024">33:44</a> 消费前的冷静思考：理性购物的重要性</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FltiRvW0r4PEm2EW-vT7NGoMLzF0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FugmUAiS1kXe5ZFQ6hcBM4vXbvob.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
